%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ab99bc6500638b47aa34d591fb280e8, type: 3}
  m_Name: JourneyDemonSettings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  demons:
  - demon: 1
    title: 恐惧
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    tint: {r: 0.48, g: 0.36, b: 0.65, a: 1}
    startProgress: 0.45
    arenaEndProgress: 0.7
    arrivalSeconds: 2
    warningSeconds: 2
    activeSeconds: 1
    recoverySeconds: 3
    secondPhaseRecovery: 2
    introduction: 看清前方的封路预警。按 J 攻击，也可以停下等待。
    resolution: 你穿过了恐惧留下的间隙。路还在前方。
  - demon: 2
    title: 焦虑
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    tint: {r: 0.9, g: 0.65, b: 0.3, a: 1}
    startProgress: 0.45
    arenaEndProgress: 0.7
    arrivalSeconds: 2
    warningSeconds: 2
    activeSeconds: 1
    recoverySeconds: 3
    secondPhaseRecovery: 2
    introduction: 先看落点，再迈步。落物不会填满所有空隙。
    resolution: 你终于找回了自己的步调。
  - demon: 3
    title: 迷茫
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    tint: {r: 0.4, g: 0.65, b: 0.75, a: 1}
    startProgress: 0.45
    arenaEndProgress: 0.7
    arrivalSeconds: 2
    warningSeconds: 2
    activeSeconds: 1
    recoverySeconds: 3
    secondPhaseRecovery: 2
    introduction: 地面的标记会告诉你，移动的障碍将去哪里。
    resolution: 答案还未齐全，你已经走出了这片雾。
  - demon: 4
    title: 压力
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    tint: {r: 0.78, g: 0.42, b: 0.38, a: 1}
    startProgress: 0.45
    arenaEndProgress: 0.7
    arrivalSeconds: 2
    warningSeconds: 2
    activeSeconds: 1
    recoverySeconds: 3
    secondPhaseRecovery: 2
    introduction: 重量落下前，先离开地面的标记。路口封闭时可以等待。
    resolution: 这一次，你为自己放下了一点重量。
  - demon: 5
    title: 死亡
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    tint: {r: 0.65, g: 0.73, b: 0.7, a: 1}
    startProgress: 0.45
    arenaEndProgress: 0.9
    arrivalSeconds: 2
    warningSeconds: 2
    activeSeconds: 1
    recoverySeconds: 3
    secondPhaseRecovery: 2
    introduction: 远处的身影没有催促你。带着这一生，慢慢向海边走。
    resolution: 你依然舍不得。但这一次，你没有再躲开。
